      "message": "test(ui): hover before the pointer click in the WCS page pick tests\n\nAfter the merge of main, the pointer click on \"Pick for WCS\" in the\nshell harness came before egui's hit test knew the row, so the row did\nnot arm. The tests now rest the pointer on the button for one frame\nbefore the press. No product code changed.\n\nRefs #1926\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
